@startuml seq-wallet-link
title Wallet Linking — signed nonce (no gas)
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant "React SPA\n(Ethers.js)" as SPA
participant MetaMask as MM
participant "Laravel API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB

User -> SPA : click "Connect wallet"
SPA -> MM : eth_requestAccounts
MM --> SPA : 0xAbC...
SPA -> MM : wallet_switchEthereumChain (Sepolia 11155111)
SPA -> API : POST /wallet/nonce
API -> DB : insert nonce (random, expires +5 min)
API --> SPA : {nonce, message}
note right of API
  message =
  "CrowdChain wallet link
   Account: user@email
   Nonce: 9f2c...
   Issued: 2026-11-26T10:00Z"
end note
SPA -> MM : personal_sign(message)
User -> MM : approve signature
MM --> SPA : signature
SPA -> API : POST /wallet/link {address, signature, nonce}
API -> DB : nonce exists, belongs to user,\nunused, not expired?
API -> API : recover signer from (message, signature)\n== address?
API -> DB : address not linked to another user?
alt all checks pass
  API -> DB : save wallet_address; mark nonce used
  API --> SPA : 200 wallet linked
else any check fails
  API --> SPA : 422 reason
end
@enduml
